--Max health is a float and aligned to 8. Goes max, something, current, invuln flag.
--Weather can't be changed unless a certain operation is NOP. Use "Find out what writes to this address" and replace the op that shows up in the middle of the loading screen "with a code that does nothing". The op is "mov [ecx],edx".
--The radar is aligned to C and 0, has 0780 below 0 and 00000010 next to that. Showing flag is -24 away. The health bar is aligned to 4 and 8, has just 07 and 00000010 to its right. Showing flag is -1C away from 8. Find these with the player's instance ID the HUD is using. A vehicle's "Controlling Me ID" is the player's ID.
--Here's boundary values top to bottom:
City 1 60 60 1340 1340
City 2 60 60 1340 1340
Suburbs 20 20 1680 1380
London 20 20 1880 1780
